cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these results, cite them via this metadata."
title: "Hadamard-T: T-matrix witnesses and the Hadamard orders they close"
abstract: >-
  Periodic T-matrix quadruples at orders 103, 101, 113, 131, 163 and 181,
  and thirteen Hadamard orders built from them by the Cooper–Wallis product
  and machine-verified in exact integer arithmetic; the order-103 quadruple
  is decoded from the publicly posted Hadamard matrix of order 2060 and
  carries no priority claim. AI-generated results with a human managing the
  workflow — produced by Claude Code (Fable 5, Anthropic); external reviews
  by GPT 5.6 (OpenAI) and by Grok (xAI), intaken and adjudicated; see
  DISCLOSURE.md.
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-29
url: "https://github.com/JD-Jones-ASES/Hadamard-T"
